  _id: plots
  _trigger:
    _kind: 3
    _target: FirstPlot
    _amount: 0
  _anywhere: 0
  _skippable: 1
  _where: 0
  _doneWhen:
    _kind: 5
    _target: FirstPlot
    _amount: 0
  _lines:
  - _speaker: villager
    _side: 1
    _expression: happy
    _text: Your Majesty! Before the fog, Dad kept two crop plots just past the Townhall.
      Best turnips in Oakville, he swore.
    _box: auto
    _point: abandoned:OldPlotSouth
    _lock: 3
    _until:
      _kind: 1
      _target: 
      _amount: 0
    _exit: 0
    _stocks: 
  - _speaker: woodcutter
    _side: 1
    _expression: 
    _text: "Turnips. Hmph. Fog\u2019s had them a year. Nothing left in there but
      weeds and a scarecrow."
    _box: auto
    _point: 
    _lock: 3
    _until:
      _kind: 1
      _target: 
      _amount: 0
    _exit: 0
    _stocks: 
  - _speaker: advisor
    _side: 0
    _expression: idea
    _text: "Weeds we can pull! First we buy the ground back from the fog \u2014 follow
      my finger, Your Majesty."
    _box: auto
    _point: abandoned:OldPlotSouthFog
    _lock: 2
    _until:
      _kind: 39
      _target: OldPlotSouth
      _amount: 0
    _exit: 0
    _stocks: 
  - _speaker: villager
    _side: 1
    _expression: surprised
    _text: "There it is! The fence is down, but the soil\u2019s still good. Open
      it, Your Majesty."
    _box: auto
    _point: abandoned:OldPlotSouth
    _lock: 2
    _until:
      _kind: 40
      _target: OldPlotSouth
      _amount: 0
    _exit: 0
    _stocks: 
  - _speaker: woodcutter
    _side: 1
    _expression: 
    _text: "A fence wants wood. Here \u2014 off my pile. Don\u2019t make a fuss."
    _box: auto
    _point: 
    _lock: 3
    _until:
      _kind: 1
      _target: 
      _amount: 0
    _exit: 0
    _stocks: FarmLands
  - _speaker: advisor
    _side: 0
    _expression: 
    _text: "Fresh seed, a new fence, and no builders needed \u2014 a field mends
      itself once it\u2019s sown. Repair it!"
    _box: auto
    _point: ui:repair
    _lock: 2
    _until:
      _kind: 41
      _target: OldPlotSouth
      _amount: 0
    _exit: 0
    _stocks: 
  - _speaker: woodcutter
    _side: 1
    _expression: 
    _text: "Sprouting already. Soil\u2019s been waiting for somebody, that\u2019s
      all."
    _box: auto
    _point: abandoned:OldPlotSouth
    _lock: 3
    _until:
      _kind: 1
      _target: 
      _amount: 0
    _exit: 0
    _stocks: 
  - _speaker: villager
    _side: 1
    _expression: happy
    _text: And the other one, right beside it! Dad always planted them in pairs.
    _box: auto
    _point: abandoned:OldPlotNorthFog
    _lock: 2
    _until:
      _kind: 39
      _target: OldPlotNorth
      _amount: 0
    _exit: 0
    _stocks: 
  - _speaker: advisor
    _side: 0
    _expression: 
    _text: "There \u2014 open it\u2026"
    _box: auto
    _point: abandoned:OldPlotNorth
    _lock: 2
    _until:
      _kind: 40
      _target: OldPlotNorth
      _amount: 0
    _exit: 0
    _stocks: 
  - _speaker: woodcutter
    _side: 1
    _expression: worried
    _text: "More wood? \u2026Fine. Last of the pile. Again."
    _box: auto
    _point: 
    _lock: 3
    _until:
      _kind: 1
      _target: 
      _amount: 0
    _exit: 0
    _stocks: FarmLands
  - _speaker: advisor
    _side: 0
    _expression: happy
    _text: "\u2026and repair it!"
    _box: auto
    _point: ui:repair
    _lock: 2
    _until:
      _kind: 41
      _target: OldPlotNorth
      _amount: 0
    _exit: 0
    _stocks: 
  - _speaker: villager
    _side: 1
    _expression: happy
    _text: "Two plots, just like Dad\u2019s! When they\u2019ve grown, tap them and
      bring the harvest in."
    _box: auto
    _point: 
    _lock: 3
    _until:
      _kind: 1
      _target: 
      _amount: 0
    _exit: 0
    _stocks: 
  - _speaker: woodcutter
    _side: 1
    _expression: 
    _text: Every sickle swing asks the well, same as an axe. Mind the blue.
    _box: auto
    _point: 
    _lock: 3
    _until:
      _kind: 1
      _target: 
      _amount: 0
    _exit: 0
